<title>USA: MBIA announces secondary market capacity.</title>
<headline>MBIA announces secondary market capacity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Tuesday it has limited capacity in the following names on a first come first serve basis.</p>
<p>--Local Government Assistance Corp(LGAC).</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Highways.</p>
<p>--New York City GOs.</p>
<p>--Port Everglades, Fla.</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico EPAs.</p>
<p>--Grand River Dam Auth, Okla.</p>
<p>--Southern California Public Power Authority, Transmission Revs.</p>
<p>Please call 1-800-MBIA-NOW for latest prices.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
